# Measured by a counted run through core/scripts/hermetic-run.sh (the judge's own J3 output). The subject's 2 starts are
# the 2 cli cells of cells.decl; every other --trunk-push drive is in process, and the inproc row counts the fx_inproc
# passes (one per tpb_ip call of vaa_main: 8 assertion drives plus the 2 in-process sides of the cli cells). `*` is
